From 0fd8469a2babf21dd467ce5103ae0ae329b6944f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 17:44:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] fix(upsync): reconcile fork behavior with upstream
 b46e214954

- await the fork's async journal save on a draining submit refusal (cron)
- move the claim-loop admission/checkpoint reads off the owner loop
- prefer upstream's per-task shell-state chain; fork overlay as fallback
- notification/auto-continue claims settle via _notif_release_claim
- adapt upstream tests to fork surfaces (refusal frame, pinned-unit notice,
  full-tree detect job, legacy fixtures) and keep file caps
